FORMAT: 1A

# 用户项目 API

用户项目 API 提供对用户项目的管理能力，包括项目的创建、删除、查询以及项目记忆目录的管理。

用户项目本质上是分布式文件系统中的文件夹，创建时会在用户容器内执行 `git init` 进行仓库初始化。

所有端点需要通过 Bearer Token 进行身份认证。

# Group 项目操作

项目的创建、查询和删除操作。

## 创建项目 [/file_system/project/create]

在分布式文件系统中创建用户项目目录并初始化 Git 仓库。可选同时创建项目记忆目录。

项目目录路径：`/<pvc_name>/pub/<project_path>`
记忆目录路径：`/<pvc_name>/sys/memory/projects/<project_path>`

### 创建项目 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "project_path": "my_project",
            "enable_memory": true
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径
    + enable_memory (boolean, optional) - 是否开启记忆功能，同时创建记忆目录。默认: `true`

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "project_path": "my_project",
            "memory_enabled": true
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "项目已存在: my_project"
        }

+ Response 503 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "容器创建超时: ..."
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 查询项目是否存在 [/file_system/project/exists]

检查指定项目的目录是否存在于分布式文件系统中。

### 查询项目 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "exists": true,
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "exists": false,
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 删除项目 [/file_system/project/delete]

递归删除项目目录和对应的记忆目录（如果存在）。

### 删除项目 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "删除项目失败"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 创建项目记忆目录 [/file_system/project/create_memory]

为已有项目单独创建记忆目录并初始化 Git 仓库。项目必须已存在，记忆目录不能已存在。

### 创建记忆目录 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Parameters
    + project_path (string, required) - 项目相对路径

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "project_path": "my_project"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "项目记忆文件夹已存在: my_project"
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "项目不存在: my_project"
        }

+ Response 503 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "容器创建超时: ..."
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

# Data Structures

## CreateProjectRequest (object)
+ project_path: `my_project` (string, required) - 项目相对路径
+ enable_memory: true (boolean, optional) - 是否开启记忆功能，默认 `true`

## CreateProjectResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ project_path: `my_project` (string) - 项目路径
+ memory_enabled: true (boolean) - 是否创建了记忆文件夹

## ProjectExistsRequest (object)
+ project_path: `my_project` (string, required) - 项目相对路径

## ProjectExistsResponse (object)
+ exists: true (boolean) - 是否存在
+ project_path: `my_project` (string) - 项目路径

## DeleteProjectRequest (object)
+ project_path: `my_project` (string, required) - 项目相对路径

## DeleteProjectResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ project_path: `my_project` (string) - 项目路径

## CreateProjectMemoryRequest (object)
+ project_path: `my_project` (string, required) - 项目相对路径

## CreateProjectMemoryResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ project_path: `my_project` (string) - 项目路径

## Error (object)
+ detail: `错误描述` (string) - 错误详情
